@base_url = http://localhost:8000

### ================= AUTH (JWT) =================

### Obtenir un token (access + refresh)
# @name login
POST {{base_url}}/api/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "nerua",
  "password": "admin"
}

###

### Rafraichir le token access a partir du refresh
POST {{base_url}}/api/token/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "{{login.response.body.refresh}}"
}

###

### ================= PAGE HTML =================

### Liste des destinations (page HTML classique)
GET {{base_url}}/destinations/

###

### ================= DESTINATIONS (lecture publique, ecriture authentifiee) =================

### Liste des destinations
GET {{base_url}}/api/destinations/

###

### Detail d'une destination
GET {{base_url}}/api/destinations/1/

###

### Creer une destination (authentification requise)
POST {{base_url}}/api/destinations/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access}}

{
  "city": "Kyoto",
  "country": "Japon",
  "continent": "asia",
  "description": "Ville historique aux nombreux temples.",
  "best_period": "Mars - Mai",
  "average_budget": 1500.00
}

###

### Modifier une destination (PUT - remplacement complet)
PUT {{base_url}}/api/destinations/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access}}

{
  "city": "Kyoto",
  "country": "Japon",
  "continent": "asia",
  "description": "Ville historique aux nombreux temples et jardins zen.",
  "best_period": "Mars - Mai",
  "average_budget": 1600.00
}

###

### Modifier une destination (PATCH - modification partielle)
PATCH {{base_url}}/api/destinations/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access}}

{
  "average_budget": 1700.00
}

###

### Supprimer une destination
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/destinations/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access}}

###

### ================= WISHES (envies de voyage - authentification requise) =================

### Liste des envies de l'utilisateur connecte
GET {{base_url}}/api/wishes/
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access}}

###

### Detail d'une envie
GET {{base_url}}/api/wishes/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access}}

###

### Creer une envie de voyage
POST {{base_url}}/api/wishes/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access}}

{
  "destination": 1,
  "priority": "high",
  "desired_period": "Ete 2027",
  "notes": "Voyage en famille"
}

###

### Modifier une envie (PUT)
PUT {{base_url}}/api/wishes/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access}}

{
  "destination": 1,
  "priority": "medium",
  "desired_period": "Automne 2027",
  "notes": "Voyage en couple",
  "visited": false
}

###

### Modifier une envie (PATCH)
PATCH {{base_url}}/api/wishes/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access}}

{
  "priority": "low"
}

###

### Marquer une envie comme visitee (action personnalisee)
POST {{base_url}}/api/wishes/1/mark-visited/
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access}}

###

### Supprimer une envie
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/wishes/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access}}

###

